<title>POLAND: Polish NBP cuts 14-day revrepo rate to 18.95 pct.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP cuts 14-day revrepo rate to 18.95 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland cut the maximum accepted 14-day reverse repo rate to 18.95 percent, from 19.12 percent at its last 14 day operation on August 20, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The average rate at the auction was 18.45 percent against 19.02 percent on August 20.</p>
<p>The NBP drained 2.46 billion zlotys from the market after banks bid to place 2.75 billion with the bank.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
